{"author":{"id":"694fb8161bd8bf91df2a28db7c649e48f8c5fa47ad3ad0234607d35f0482801a"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1789291036,"nonce":"YC3/KNqahI83Eonc0t4mLHoZlXg=","title":"Compile-time seam: install an external class as a ClassMir with bridge-bound methods","message":"The run-time seam (runtime::rt) lets a host supply the memory under\nwren_lift's Immix. A host that also brings other languages needs a\ncompile-time seam: a way to install a class defined elsewhere as one of\nwren_lift's own classes, so `import \"game:Player\" for Player` yields a\nclass sema types, the tiers optimise and the JIT inline-caches exactly\nlike a Wren class, with each method's body landing in the host's bridge.\n\nTwo pieces:\n\n1. A MIR instruction `CallBridge { target: u32, args: Vec\u003cValueId\u003e,\n   ret: MirType }`. `target` is an opaque id the host registered; the\n   interpreter and both native tiers lower it to a direct call of a\n   host-installed C entry `(target, receiver, args, nargs) -\u003e Value`\n   with the usual runtime-error path (a host error aborts the fiber like\n   any runtime error). No dispatch by name, no string keys.\n\n2. An install hook: `VM::install_external_class(module, ClassMir)` (or a\n   `ModuleMir` of such classes through the existing install_module_mir\n   route), where each MethodMir's body is a stub MirFunction that loads\n   its arguments and issues CallBridge. Instances are ordinary\n   ObjInstance of that class; the host reserves one hidden field slot\n   (num_fields = 1) for its handle. sema needs the class's method\n   signatures and return types at resolve time: the hook takes an\n   interface (methods with arities, static flags, return types mapped\n   onto InferredType) so inference downstream is as precise as for Wren\n   code.\n\nThe existing resolve_module_fn / load_module_fn callbacks stay for source\nmodules; a host answers a namespaced import by installing the class\nthrough the hook instead of returning source.\n\nDefault path unchanged: with no host, CallBridge is never emitted.","files":null}]}